{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"安宁让他又感到那种亲近；身体先绷紧，他才发现威胁仍在，懊恼自己沉进去，忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"威胁仍在\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起当初不肯再等，是不愿看着珍惜的东西继续受损；光在心里怀念，护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却不敢像从前那样不顾一切，怕争取到最后只剩硬撑，把想留住的温柔也耗尽。\",\n      \"key\": \"想留住的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清当初为何不能再等，就能安心往前；如今他发现自己的顾虑也不是没道理，反而更难决定。\",\n      \"key\": \"顾虑也不是没道理\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁带来的真实亲近、现实威胁仍在时身体先受惊，以及他沉浸后发现自己忘了面对事情的懊恼。删去生活就在眼前与生活还没回来之间的重复表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不能只靠怀念改变现实，以及当初不肯再等、不愿看着珍惜之物继续受损的具体理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他已不能像从前那样毫无顾忌地投入，以及害怕争取到最后只剩硬撑、耗尽想留住的温柔。把失去值得争取的心落实为他害怕耗尽的具体东西。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\", \"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆并\",\n      \"why\": \"留下怀念护不住珍惜之物和争取可能耗尽温柔这两面真实风险，分别并入已有条目，删除重复的对称两难句。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留原先以为找到行动理由就能安心、如今理由增加反而更难决定的变化。不再重复S07-3对温柔受损的担忧，而是指出连顾虑本身也有真实来由。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料身份的另一种辨认，不是必须由人物心理解释的主体验，不强行补出他重新找回旧日自我的经历。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9779e02d-ac97-4c52-aeb2-37fc6b4e7fd0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002727436479Z", "elapsed_seconds": 145.688, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:29:53.131850+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "344e5994eaebda9db60c5d51b0bcdcfa3c1c37109184ae5cc0b6cd614a8cd8d0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256"